# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

{{ .Description | trimspace }}

`users` is the complete membership of the group: the group ends up with
**exactly** the users listed, and any other member is removed on the next
apply, including members added by `minio_iam_user_group_membership` or
`minio_iam_group_user_attachment`. Manage a group's members with this
resource or with one of those two, never with more than one of the three
at once.

